  "input": {
    "handle": "native-works-tank-popper-190",
    "title": "Native Works Tank Popper 190",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>This product is made for GT. It was developed with the aim of reducing fatigue from casting to action and allowing the angler to continue throwing.We designed it to have the lowest possible center of gravity, and made it so that it would resonate more bass than splashing.The shape reduces action errors as much as possible, so it can be used in any sea conditions. It has a particularly good track record in deep water. As a result of prioritizing flying distance and action by using special wood, we have judged that the goodness of the product will be lost if more strength is demanded.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Recommended Hook BKK-Z Raptor 5/0 or equivelant.</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length 190 mm</span></p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Gr. 120</span></p></li></ul>",
